         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Modern vector icon of airplane flight, travelling around the world, vacation trip . Premium quality vector illustration concept. Flat line icon symbol. Flat design image isolated on white background.&#xA;</rdf:li>
